{"word":"ζῷον","uri":"zôon","senses":[{"word":"ζῷον","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ζῷον,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ου</span>\n<span class=\"art\">(<span class=\"grec\">τὸ</span>)</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> tout être vivant :\n<span class=\"grec\">πᾶν ὅ τι περ ἂν μετάσχῃ τοῦ ζῆν ζῷον ἂν\nλέγοιτο,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Tim.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">77</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, tout ce qui participe à la vie (<span class=\"grec\">τοῦ ζῆν</span>) pourrait être appelé animal (<span class=\"grec\">ζῷον</span>); <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Vesp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">551,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">particul.</span> animal,\n<span class=\"ital\">p. opp. aux plantes</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Phæd.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">70</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span>, <span class=\"refpa\">110</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span>, <span class=\"ital\">ou aux arbres</span>, <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">233</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">en parl. des hommes et des animaux, p. opp. aux\nreptiles,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 95</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">p.\next.</span> personnage <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> figure (d’homme\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> d’animal) représentés dans un tableau,\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 88,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">515</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"grec\">ζῷα ποιεῖν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Per.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1